<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Credit Communal raises savings rates.</title>
<headline>Belgian Credit Communal raises savings rates.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's Credit Communal said on Monday it would raise interest rates on its bank savings certificates from Tuesday December 17.</p>
<p>    MATURITY	  NEW RATE	OLD RATE</p>
<p>    one year	  2.80 pct	2.75</p>
<p>    three years     3.80 pct	3.65</p>
<p>    five years	4.70 pct	4.50</p>
<p>NOTE -</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
